; bookkeeping file v2.10 and UAE file v2 (Point Sixteen EUR 34,790.50; The Ocean EUR 84,344.70; Ekmekci equity value EUR 165,743).
; Rate: CBUAE 30-12-2025 (last publication of the year) 1 EUR = 4.319572 AED, source centralbank.ae fx_dec25_en.pdf.
; Investments are held in EUR with the cost in AED recorded ({...}): non-monetary, never revalued.
; Vendor loans are held in EUR with @ rate: monetary, revalued at month-end.
; Flag "!" = to be verified: purchase prices against the signed SPAs, terms of the vendor loans (Dropbox), capital payment.

